Main Objective : 

Learn to make an existing website work on phones, tablets and laptops.

What You Will Implement : 

Take one earlier project (Assignment 6 or 7):

-> Add at least two breakpoints (for example 768px and 480px) using @media queries.
-> Test on at least 3 screen sizes using browser DevTools (mobile, tablet, desktop).
-> Audit and fix problems: text too small, images overflowing, horizontal scrolling, buttons too close.
